# THE FIRST STEPS (FirstSteps, 58_guide, UiStepMark; owner, 2026-10-13): Maren's
# errand as a card of one-mechanic steps on the slate, the step under way lit
# with its count and its key, and an arrow over what it is about, at the glass's
# edge with how far when it is off it. The errand's first half is played from the
# title in tours/home-coast.tour; this is its second half, from a pick in hand:
# find it in what you carry, iron out of a slab, the survey with the crew's camp
# marked, and the arrow out to the camp.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/first-steps.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --beats=marens_lead --give=pick:1
wait 2.0
shot 01-find-it-in-what-you-carry with step:carry
tap inventory
await app:inventory 3
tap inventory
await app:none 3
wait 1.0
shot 02-break-iron-out-of-a-slab with step:iron
try 3
  near rebar_slab
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:rebar 20
end
wait 1.0
shot 03-open-the-survey with step:survey
tap map
await app:map 3
wait 0.6
shot 04-the-crew-marked with app:map
tap map
await app:none 3
wait 1.0
shot 05-out-to-the-camp with step:camp
